{"id":"9648b1de11d1e866","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite.md","title":"Reflexive Arithmetic Interpretation Obstructs Finite Axiomatization","display":"thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite — Reflexive Arithmetic Interpretation Obstructs Finite Axiomatization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite","aliases":["67-thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite"],"display":"thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite — Reflexive Arithmetic Interpretation Obstructs Finite Axiomatization","depends_on":["[[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]","[[67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]","[[67-df-general-consistency]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_scope":"第 8 章 §1，Corollary 1，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述及有限公理化到有限子理论解释的归约已复核；继承一般无有限子理论解释的限制","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflexive-interpretation-nonfinite — Reflexive Arithmetic Interpretation Obstructs Finite Axiomatization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb51163c70a06b3c\" href=\"?note=fb51163c70a06b3c\" title=\"67-df-reflexive-interpretation\">67-df-reflexive-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61b6be0b454e900c\" href=\"?note=61b6be0b454e900c\" title=\"67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory\">67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 8 章 §1，Corollary 1，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及有限公理化到有限子理论解释的归约已复核；继承一般无有限子理论解释的限制"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 是有限有效一阶语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\)</span> 是一致 PR 公理呈示，采用本册固定强编号和证明算术化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>一般解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd_{L,K}\">\\(\\unlhd_{L,K}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"433a5a5e16d90414\" href=\"?note=433a5a5e16d90414\" title=\"67-df-general-relative-interpretation\">67-df-general-relative-interpretation</a>；一般语言的算术一致性句和代码有界公理片段取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a>。下标标出源、目标语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 的量化与公式编码均在元层。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\unlhd^r_K T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\unlhd^r_K T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fb51163c70a06b3c\" href=\"?note=fb51163c70a06b3c\" title=\"67-df-reflexive-interpretation\">67-df-reflexive-interpretation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\mathrm{Sent}_K]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\mathrm{Sent}_K]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 表示全部有限句子集合。有限公理化按与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的全部句子定理等价定义，而非要求给定公理表本身有限。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>语法和证明参数固定为本册 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_K=c_K\">\\(g_K=c_K\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{K,T},D,\\gamma\">\\(e_{K,T},D,\\gamma\\)</span>；所有有限片段使用同一演算和该文件声明的程序图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" href=\"?note=a4af62d1c1b0b08f\" title=\"67-df-general-consistency\">67-df-general-consistency</a> 的同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_K\">\\(\\pi_K\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)\\)</span>；本条所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-公理集及其有限片段的一致性句均由该系统绑定，因而包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdGPrf}\\)</span> 的 PA 内桥接条件。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists F\\in[\\mathrm{Sent}_K]^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\\n(F\\vdash\\theta\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists F\\in[\\mathrm{Sent}_K]^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\\n(F\\vdash\\theta\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>若有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 定理等价，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中有一个有限证明，因此存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，使这些证明全落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\upharpoonright k\">\\(T\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 内。因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 证明每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公理，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\upharpoonright k\">\\(T\\upharpoonright k\\)</span> 也证明每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公理，故恒等翻译给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\unlhd T\\upharpoonright k\">\\(T\\unlhd T\\upharpoonright k\\)</span>，违反 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"61b6be0b454e900c\" href=\"?note=61b6be0b454e900c\" title=\"67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory\">67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory</a>。这是利用第8章稍后较强结果的本地短推导。单纯“若给定公理表有限则取足够大的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>”不足以覆盖任意有限等价公理化，本条结论采用原书实际较强的版本。</p>\n<p>源书 Corollary1 沿用第2章的推导；这里没有从外部存在逐公理证明臆造 PA 内统一的标准一致性转移。实际所用 Theorem7 的呈示变更和 Theorem3(b) 仍有未完证明义务，故 eligible=false。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 8 章 §1，Corollary 1，印刷页 120；PDF 第 131 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：陈述及有限公理化到有限子理论解释的归约已复核；继承一般无有限子理论解释的限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-reflexive-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"fb51163c70a06b3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-reflexive-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"61b6be0b454e900c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-relative-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"433a5a5e16d90414","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-relative-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-general-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","locati