ing]] 的 $g_K=c_K$ 及 [[67-df-general-consistency]] 的 $e_{K,T},D,\\gamma$；所有有限片段使用同一演算和该文件声明的程序图。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-general-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"a4af62d1c1b0b08f","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[67-df-general-consistency]] 的同一个 $\\pi_K$，满足 $\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)$；本条所有 $K$-公理集及其有限片段的一致性句均由该系统绑定，因而包含 $\\mathrm{StdGPrf}$ 的 PA 内桥接条件。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"61b6be0b454e900c","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"若有限 $F$ 与 $T$ 定理等价，每个 $F$ 公理在 $T$ 中有一个有限证明，因此存在 $k$，使这些证明全落在 $T\\upharpoonright k$ 内。因 $F$ 证明每个 $T$ 公理，$T\\upharpoonright k$ 也证明每个 $T$ 公理，故恒等翻译给出 $T\\unlhd T\\upharpoonright k$，违反 [[67-thm-general-no-finite-subtheory]]。这是利用第8章稍后较强结果的本地短推导。单纯“若给定公理表有限则取足够大的 $k$”不足以覆盖任意有限等价公理化，本条结论采用原书实际较强的版本。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}_{L_A,K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\unlhd_{L,K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\unlhd^r_K T","display":false},{"tex":"[\\mathrm{Sent}_K]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"g_K=c_K","display":false},{"tex":"e_{K,T},D,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GPrfSystem}_K(\\pi_K)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdGPrf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists F\\in[\\mathrm{Sent}_K]^{<\\omega}\\\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_K\\\n(F\\vdash\\theta\\Longleftrightarrow T\\vdash\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"T\\upharpoonright k","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":